 "comments": [
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "Myozenins may serve as intracellular binding proteins involved in linking Z line proteins such as alpha-actinin, gamma-filamin, TCAP/telethonin, LDB3/ZASP and localizing calcineurin signaling to the sarcomere. Plays an important role in the modulation of calcineurin signaling. May play a role in myofibrillogenesis"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
